<% content_for :reason, "#{Setting.current.brand_name} gave this address access to the portal for #{@contact.client.name}." %>
Hi <%= @contact.name.split.first %>,

We've set up a portal for <%= @contact.client.name %>. There you can see what we're working on for you and how far along it is, read and answer our messages, find the files we've shared, and ask for anything new.

There's no password. This link signs you in (once, for a week); next time the sign-in page emails you a fresh one:
<%= @url %>
